    <string name="settings_erase_summary">Put the app back to how it was on the day you installed it.</string>
    <string name="erase_title">Erase everything?</string>
    <string name="erase_body">This empties the library, your collections, the bookmarks, the saved words and the tags, hands back every folder you gave the app access to, deletes the downloaded translation models, and puts every setting back to its default. The whole-device sweep is switched off as well, so the library does not simply fill up again; you can turn it back on from the sources at the top of the library.\n\nYour PDFs are not touched. They stay exactly where they are on your phone.\n\nThis cannot be undone.</string>
